  "body": "Introduces governed knowledge ingestion and bounded knowledge scopes for future retrieval, using formal Phase 1E context. Reuses Phase 1C sources/collections/bindings and Phase 1B canonical legal structures, citations and durable review; PostgreSQL remains authoritative.\n\nAdds versioned canonical structure and chunks, HTTPS source controls, durable outbox/Redis ingestion, independent review and publication, translation provenance, and derived FTS/vector/embedding foundations in migration `0006_phase1f`.\n\nKnowledgeScopeResolver returns permission and effective-version hard filters for projects, data items and flows. Multi-product items keep minimal scopes; unresolved product context fails safely. Snapshots freeze the shared knowledge/binding universe and formal product hierarchy across subjects, while current permission/source revocation can narrow access.\n\nValidation: mandatory real PostgreSQL/runtime suite **142 passed / 0 skipped / 0 deselected**; Phase 1F schema **29/29**; architecture **77/77**; Phase 1A runtime **25/25**; Phase 1A–1E regressions PASS. Migration upgrade/downgrade/re-upgrade passed in an empty isolated database.\n\nAll 16 delivery documents and [Phase1G_entry_decision.md](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/blob/phase1f-knowledge-scope/Phase1G_entry_decision.md) are committed. The entry decision was issued after documentation-closure [Run 36973990791](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/36973990791) succeeded at `7391b9728e788b70e11885fe23d64980dcc3db37`; artifact `11212349170`, digest `sha256:b31ac0fe52e103fa291e2c5f1356bee52a47ffd0fa0fc3b4f9774534cf43b47d`. Raw GitHub API/Checks evidence and full local gate logs are stored under `evidence/phase1f`.\n\nCurrent ingestion accepts canonical structured JSON; embedding tests use deterministic adapters resolved through Phase 1C model metadata. No Phase 1G retrieval/reranking/RAG or compliance decision logic is included. The PR remains draft and is not merged.\n\nPost-issuance governance verification: [Run 36974356188](https://github.com/bensuen0831/crossborder-compliance-agent/actions/runs/36974356188) **SUCCESS** at `817ef5f2762dfc95295f0fcf109506059774dce5`; mandatory 142-test suite and all gates PASS. Artifact `11213125920`, digest `sha256:f8e5f7e215f33b9d5e7b4d2115861210565bc95d7319b00b90e358f9ecf47f84`. This documentation-only commit preserves the signed pre-issuance evidence identity.\n",
